T1  - Has generative artificial intelligence solved inverse materials design?
AU  - Park, Hyunsoo
AU  - Li, Zhenzhu
AU  - Walsh, Aron
JO  - Matter
VL  - 7
IS  - 7
SP  - 2355
EP  - 2367
PY  - 2024
