T1  - Real-World Evidence Synthesis of Digital Scribes Using Ambient Listening and Generative Artificial Intelligence for Clinician Documentation Workflows: Rapid Review
AU  - Kanaparthy, Naga Sasidhar
AU  - Villuendas-Rey, Yenny
AU  - Bakare, Tolulope
