T1  - POS0311 SARCOIDOSIS AS A SYSTEMIC DISEASE: IDENTIFYING PATTERNS OF MULTIORGAN-SPECIFIC INVOLVEMENT AND EPIDEMIOLOGICAL PROFILING THROUGH GENERATIVE ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE-DRIVEN CLUSTERING
AU  - Brito-Zerón, P.
AU  - Flores-Chávez, A.
