T1  - ABS0885 COMPLEMENT CONSUMPTION PATTERNS AS AN EARLY PREDICTOR OF SYSTEMIC SJÖGREN DISEASE: GENERATIVE ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE-ASSISTED ANALYSIS USING STRATIFIED CROSS-VALIDATION GENERALIZABILITY MODELS
AU  - Brito-Zerón, P.
